%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
### Bandpass filter definition
Define a bandpass filter function with adjustable center frequency (vc) and quality factor (q) for isolating specific spectral regions

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  InitGroup: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
filter[vc_, q_][list_List] := BandpassFilter[list, {{vc, q}}]

