## Enhanced UI layout
Create a polished, modern interface using WLX (Wolfram Language XML) with custom CSS styling for improved user experience

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.wlx
<div class="widget-page">
<style>
  .widget-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    background: #f5f7fb;
    color: #1f2937;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .widget-card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #d9e1ec;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .widget-header {
    padding: 20px 24px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5eaf1;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff, #f8fafc);
  }

  .widget-header h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  .widget-header p {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    color: #5b6575;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .widget-body {
    padding: 20px 24px 24px;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .widget-body > * {
    width: 100%;
  }
</style>  
  <section class="widget-card">
    <header class="widget-header">
      <div>
        <h2>Spectrogram Explorer</h2>
        <p>Adjust windowing and other parameters to inspect the signal.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="widget-body">
      <Widget/>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

